# Backend config (loaded by the backend via dotenv).
# Copy to .env and fill in. `!` = required. See README "Run / setup" for details.

# Required — the directory your projects live in (where sessions spawn).
WORK_DIR!

NODE_ENV
HOST
PORT

# Required in production (comma-separated allowed browser origins).
ALLOWED_ORIGINS!

# Optional.
# LOG_LEVEL — comma-separated levels (debug,info,warn,error). Default: info,error.
# HOOKS_PORT
# DUMP_DIR
# PTY_COLS
# PTY_ROWS
# CLAUDE_BIN — absolute path to the Claude Code binary. Default: claude (off PATH).
# IDLE_STOP_MINUTES — stop an unwatched, idle session's PTY after this long (it resumes when reopened). Default: 30. 0 disables.
